"name": "Escalation",
"stratConScenarioType": "NONE",
"shortBriefing": "A skirmish that both sides keep feeding until it becomes a battle.",
"detailedBriefing": "What began as a chance skirmish is drawing in everything both sides can throw at it. Reserves are already moving up on both ends, and the fight will only grow uglier as they arrive.\n\nWin the early exchange, and you set the terms; lose it, and you will be reacting to their reinforcements instead of your own. Hold your line through the opening clash, commit your reserves at the right moment, and grind the enemy down as the battle swells around you.\n\nBreak the enemy force as the fight escalates. The victor holds the field.",
